    [[Implement]] [[Passed]] All five target checks, 431 macOS tests, both Linux portable text tests, renderer Clippy and license checks passed on signed commit 39cd788f967e2f351e841b30ccf4a2c0fe53566b. Added Swash with the existing JetBrains Mono font, enabled CoreText on iOS and removed the error-only text paths and the macOS-only GPU refusal. [[Blocked]] **Unblock** Assign repairs for the existing CI fixture missing test-harness-source, the restoring-workspaces parity tree mismatch and the Yarn diagnostic snapshots on Rust 1.100.0, then rebase and rerun the gates before make land. The startup case rendered byte-identical PNGs on the candidate and the unmodified base. The worktree is clean.

